      "headline": "Chip stocks had their worst day since March 2020. The companies that buy the chips held up.",
      "line": "Chips' worst day since March 2020",
      "narrator": "Sensors logged the chip sector's hardest hit in over six years. Three earnings reports are inbound before the picture clears.",
