        }
      ],
      "more": [
        {
          "text": "On Thursday SMH, the fund that holds the chip stocks, fell 11.2%. NVDA fell 9.3%, AMD 17.3%, MU 17.5% and CRWV 9.8%. QQQ fell 6.5%.",
          "mark": "measured",
          "source": "Yahoo daily closes, 2026-11-04 to 2026-11-05, fetched 2026-11-07"
        },
        {
          "text": "Press tied the drop to Tuesday's midterms: Democrats swept Congress, and voters rejected data-center construction in 40 of 41 local ballot measures. Press also cited a weak forecast from Qualcomm.",
          "mark": "reported",
          "source": "CNBC 2026-11-05, as cited in docs/research/events/crwv-2026-11-10-print.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "The one check set in advance asked whether stocks that sell power to data centers beat the market on a political day. On Thursday they beat it by 0.7 points, inside the 4.39-point line that would count, so the election link is not measured.",
          "mark": "measured",
          "source": "docs/research/drop-exits-nvda-crwv-2026-11.md (#6951)"
        },
        {
          "text": "On Friday NVDA opened 5.2% higher and closed at 186.64. CRWV closed at 46.40, up 6.3%.",
          "mark": "measured",
          "source": "Yahoo daily closes, 2026-11-06, fetched 2026-11-07"
        },
        {
          "text": "After NVDA's past drops of 7% or more, a +5% take-profit set at the close filled 38% of the time, against 12% from an ordinary day. A filled exit is not a profit: the same rule made money 52% of the time, against 53% from any day.",
          "mark": "measured",
          "source": "scripts/research/drop-exit-study.mjs, docs/research/drop-exits-nvda-crwv-2026-11.md (#6951)",
          "n": 65
        },
        {
          "text": "The house holds nothing through these three reports, and it records dips rather than trading them.",
          "mark": "call",
          "source": "docs/research/dip-entries-nvda-crwv.md; docs/research/events/crwv-2026-11-10-print.md; docs/research/events/nvda-2026-11-18-print.md"
        }
      ]
    },
