        {
          "text": "AMD's Nov 3 results beat, with data-center sales up 97%, yet AMD fell 17.3% two sessions later. Meta's capex raise on Oct 21 is where press dates the start of this run of chip selling.",
          "mark": "reported",
          "source": "docs/research/events/nvda-2026-11-18-print.md (11-05 row); docs/research/events/midterm-elections-2026-11-03.md (10-27 row)"
        },
        {
          "text": "CRWV moved with Nebius (correlation 0.886 over 39 sessions) far more than with NVDA (0.608), and CoreWeave has filed no company news since Sep 22. It is trading with its group, not on its own story.",
